  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Environmental System Support Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo al Sistema Nacional Ambiental</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims at contributing to the improvement of the current state of the country&apos;s natural resources and environment, through the following actions: i. Increasing the knowledge in environmental matters and improving the National Environmental System and ii. Executing programs and projects to restore, conserve, protect and use natural resources within a participative and consensus context.</narrative>
